<section class="section section-tight" id="educators"><div class="container"><div class="section-head-row"><div><div class="eyebrow">Our Educators</div><h2 class="section-title" style="margin-bottom:8px">A Culture of Learning, Led by Educators.</h2><p class="section-sub">Our educators bring Lexicon’s philosophy to life every day. We invest in their continuous development through training, workshops, exposure to new teaching practices and technology, and by recognising their commitment and impact.</p></div><a class="text-link" href="#educators">Explore Our Educators</a></div><div class="educator-grid"><article class="educator-card"><img alt="Professional development workshop" src="/assets/images/about/about-educator1.webp"/><div><h4>Workshops &amp; Professional Development</h4><p>Regular learning and development sessions help our educators strengthen their practice and exchange ideas.</p></div></article><article class="educator-card"><img alt="Technology in classrooms" src="/assets/images/about/about-educator2.webp"/><div><h4>Technology &amp; Evolving Teaching Practices</h4><p>Our educators engage with new tools and methodologies to make learning more relevant and effective.</p></div></article><article class="educator-card"><img alt="Educator awards" src="/assets/images/about/about-educator3.webp"/><div><h4>Educator Awards &amp; Recognition</h4><p>We celebrate educators whose commitment, innovation and impact strengthen the learning experience.</p></div></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section section-tight" id="governance"><div class="container"><div class="eyebrow">Governance &amp; Affiliations</div><h2 class="section-title">Built on Strong Foundations.</h2><div class="foundation-grid"><article class="foundation-card"><h4>CBSE Affiliation</h4><p>Our schools are affiliated to the Central Board of Secondary Education (CBSE).</p><a href="/legal/disclosure">View CBSE Information →</a></article><article class="foundation-card"><h4>Mandatory Public Disclosure</h4><p>Information is available for all three schools as per CBSE requirements.</p><a href="/legal/disclosure">View Disclosures →</a></article><article class="foundation-card"><h4>Policies &amp; Governance</h4><p>Our policies ensure a safe, inclusive and well-governed learning environment.</p><a href="/legal/terms">View Policies →</a></article></div></div></section>
